# UKSC_Errors
Adds support for encoding errors in a common way and sorting their priorities. Allows communication of these error messages via the FlexCAN library

# Note
If you decide to add a library, follow these steps so that changes are properly reflected both here and where the library will be used.

# Expanding the library of error types
Feel free to add more enumerated types to the **alertEnums.h** file. This helps to maintain Alert encoding style across all the boards into the future.

# Warning
The Alert class will crash silently during sorting if you are not using ChibiOS threads. All boards should at least do **chBegin()** to run from instead of going to **void loop()**

# Examples
Look at the UKSC_Alert_Test.ino file in the examples folder.